# Historian Frontend Environment Configuration
# Google OAuth 2.0 Web Application Client ID
# Obtain from Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Ensure Authorized JavaScript Origins includes: http://localhost:5173
# Ensure Authorized Redirect URIs includes: http://localhost:5173/login

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
